      "title": "Efficiency scorecard  ·  where the money goes",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "cacheRead / cacheCreation — how many times you reused what you paid to cache. THE headline efficiency number. Red below 2x is arithmetic: cache writes cost 2x input at the 1h TTL Claude Code uses, so below ~2.1 reuses caching costs more than sending fresh. The yellow/green bands are YOUR baseline, not an industry norm — from 14 sessions: p25 9x, median 15x, p75 28x. Recalibrate as you accumulate more. Raise it with `claude --continue` instead of a fresh session.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 1,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 2 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 9 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 15 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 17,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage{type=\"cacheRead\", project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) / sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage{type=\"cacheCreation\", project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "A",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Cache amortization",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Share of spend going to WRITING the cache. Cache writes cost 2x input (1h TTL), reads 0.1x — a 20x spread — so writes dominate the bill even at a small share of tokens. Do NOT try to drive this to zero: writes are the cost of admission, and no writes means no cheap reads. Under ~30% is healthy; over 50% means sessions are dying before they amortize.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 1,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 30 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 50 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 6 },
      "id": 13,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_cost_usd{type=\"cacheCreation\", project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) / sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_cost_usd{project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) * 100",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "A",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Cache write % of cost",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "output / cacheRead. Output is the priciest lane at 5x input (50x a cache read), and extended thinking is billed as output. Bands are YOUR baseline from 14 sessions: median 1.0%, p75 2.0%, max 12.5%. Above ~2% means generation-heavy work — justified for writing code, less so for reading. Lower it with reduced effort and targeted edits over whole-file rewrites.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 2,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 2 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 6 },
      "id": 18,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage{type=\"output\", project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) / sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage{type=\"cacheRead\", project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) * 100",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "A",
